    "blocks_NgyNz4": {
      "type": "_blocks",
      "blocks": {
        "ai_gen_block_fb81b45_qVFqqX": {
          "type": "ai_gen_block_fb81b45",
          "settings": {
            "desktop_width_percent": 100,
            "max_width": 1200,
            "section_padding": 20,
            "background_color": "#f9f6f1",
            "heading": "<p>The verdict for first-time buyers</p>",
            "heading_size": 60,
            "heading_color": "#000000",
            "heading_spacing": 10,
            "box_color": "#8b1d22",
            "box_radius": 25,
            "box_padding": 40,
            "box_spacing": 10,
            "box_paragraph_1": "<p>If you have been spending $150 to $300 on a bottle of fragrance and wearing it sparingly because it feels too good to use up every day, an inspired alternative from a quality range is worth trying seriously. The question is not really whether it smells<br/>exactly the same. It is whether it smells good enough to wear every day, with confidence, at a price that means you actually will.<br/><br/></p>",
            "box_paragraph_2": "<p>For most of the fragrances in our collection, the answer to that question is yes. The Scentspired perfume collection is available to browse and buy perfume online, with every fragrance listing its notes and its inspiration so you know exactly what you are getting before you hit that checkout button.</p>",
            "box_paragraph_3": "",
            "box_text_color": "#ffffff",
            "box_text_size": 22,
            "box_text_line_height": 1.6,
            "paragraph_spacing": 25,
